# MesoConnect licensing and data-use notice

This repository contains several kinds of material. The terms below apply according to file type. No section grants rights that the MesoConnect contributors do not own.

## 1. Atlas data

The MesoConnect NIfTI atlas maps, subject-count tables, and other data products derived from WU-Minn Human Connectome Project data are redistributed under the WU-Minn HCP Consortium Open Access Data Use Terms:

https://hcp-db.humanconnectome.org/study/hcp-young-adult/document/wu-minn-hcp-consortium-open-access-data-use-terms

Users must comply with the official terms, including the requirements concerning participant identification, institutional oversight, redistribution of original or derived HCP data, acknowledgment of HCP support, and citation of relevant HCP methods publications. The official HCP terms control if this notice and the official terms differ.

This section is a data-use notice. It does not replace or modify the WU-Minn HCP Consortium Open Access Data Use Terms.

## 2. Documentation and original media

Unless a file states otherwise, the README files, original tutorial text, and original MesoConnect figures are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License:

https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Attribution should identify the MesoConnect authors, link to the source repository and license, and indicate whether changes were made. This license does not apply to third-party materials or to the HCP-derived atlas data covered by Section 1.

